A NAME AFTER A SEMICOLON IN THE HEADER IS LOCAL: IT EXISTS
WHILE THE FUNCTION RUNS AND IS GONE AFTER. MEAN USES ONE:

      ∇R←MEAN V;N
[1]   N←⍴V
[2]   R←(+/V)÷N
[3]   ∇

