A QUOTE-QUAD READS THE LINE AS CHARACTERS, UNEVALUATED. ON
THE LEFT OF AN ARROW IT PRINTS WITHOUT ENDING THE LINE, SO
A PROMPT AND ITS ANSWER SHARE ONE. GREET USES BOTH:

      ∇GREET;W
[1]   ⍞←'YOUR NAME? '
[2]   W←⍞
[3]   'HELLO, ',W
[4]   ∇

