GUESS PUTS IT TOGETHER: A QUESTION, A QUAD, A COMPARISON,
AND A BRANCH BACK UNTIL THE ANSWER IS RIGHT.

      ∇GUESS;N;G
[1]   N←?10
[2]   L:'A NUMBER FROM 1 TO 10?'
[3]   G←⎕
[4]   →(G=N)/WIN
[5]   'NO. AGAIN.'
[6]   →L
[7]   WIN:'YES.'
[8]   ∇

      GUESS

