AT THE PROMPT IT IS DIFFERENT. OOPS PRINTS BEFORE, THEN THE
REPORT WITH OOPS[2] IN FRONT OF THE STATEMENT, AND STOPS
THERE, SUSPENDED: ITS LOCALS ARE STILL THERE TO LOOK AT.
)SI SHOWS IT WITH A STAR, → ALONE ABANDONS IT, AND →3 GOES
ON FROM LINE 3. WHEN THIS LESSON ENDS, TRY:

      OOPS
      )SI
      →3
      )SI

A SUSPENSION LEFT BEHIND KEEPS ITS LOCALS AND HIDES ANY
GLOBALS OF THE SAME NAMES. CLEAR EACH WITH → UNTIL )SI
PRINTS NOTHING; )SIV SHOWS WHAT NAMES EACH ONE HOLDS.

